7. Write some pseudocode to describe the following problem:
The Fibonacci sequence is as follows: 0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, 21 etc. As you can see, from the
third number onwards each number is the sum of the two previous ones. Write to stdout all the
numbers in the Fibonacci sequence up to the number given.

OUTPUT”give me a number”
INPUT number from keyboard as number
COMPUTE store FibonacciNum as 1 and PreviousNum as 0 and CurrentNumber as 0
WHILE CurrentNumber < number
	COMPUTE CurrentNumber = FibonacciNum + PreviousNum
	SET previousNum = FibonacciNum
	SET FibonacciNum = CurrentNumber
	OUTPUT CurrentNumber to user
ENDWHILE


